  pageNumber: 4
  noteTitle: 4/4 Note about the Elevator
  noteContent: Someone tried to force open the elevator. I called maintenance, but
    they said it's a serious failure, the cables are probably snapped. The elevator
    is out of service for the next few days. Gotta put up a sign. Too bad, would've
    been easier to go up with these boxes.
